{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t政府公布10月至12月的賣地計劃，將會推售一幅位於沙田石門的住宅地，預計可以提供大約960個單位。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n發展局局長甯漢豪表示，今年首三季私人房屋土地供應，預計合共可以提供15680個單位，已超越12600個單位的年度供應目標，但不會因為純粹數字達標，就放慢推地步伐。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：朱錫君\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:00:13.156359+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:46:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T15:38:26.842413+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:57:45.419591+00:00","content_hash":"08d6125861076ac1de45653e5f7e7fb886d9398817ba008dce2dc2051263946d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}